The ShopDesk demo app in demo/ is part of this project and was written for it. Its product names and data are
fictional.

The framework builds on these libraries (restored from NuGet, not redistributed in this repository):

* FlaUI (MIT) - UI Automation for .NET
* NUnit (MIT) and the NUnit3 test adapter (MIT)
* Allure .NET (Apache-2.0)
* FluentAssertions 7.x (Apache-2.0) - newer major versions use a commercial license and are not used
* WireMock.Net (Apache-2.0)
* Microsoft.Extensions.Configuration (MIT)
